"Router) alkalmazás ([`@pantoken/next`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/"
"@pantoken/next)).\n"
"\n"
"## Fejlesztés\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
